# Hoist the firebase-functions CLI binary to the workspace-root node_modules/.bin.
#
# firebase.json points the Functions emulator at the compiled output
# (source: "apps/functions/lib"), which has no node_modules of its own. The
# Functions emulator resolves the `firebase-functions` binary by checking, in
# order: <source>/node_modules/.bin, <projectRoot>/node_modules/.bin, and the
# pnpm store — but NOT apps/functions/node_modules/.bin, where pnpm normally
# places it. Without this hoist the emulator fails with "Failed to find
# location of Firebase Functions SDK", the callable functions never load, and
# the E2E specs that depend on syncMyClaims (special-access routes) fail.
public-hoist-pattern[]=firebase-functions
